ource src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1416360/extras/edd0227ed8545cbf08a02aadbd259155.webm?t=1754055653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1416360/extras/edd0227ed8545cbf08a02aadbd259155.mp4?t=1754055653\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
